    "answer": {
      "short": "$60\\text{ m}^2$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}s&=\\sqrt{2^2+1.5^2}=2.5\\text{ m}\\\\A_{\\text{platform}}&=2(3\\times4+3\\times1.5+4\\times1.5)=45\\\\A_{\\text{ramp}}&=2\\left(\\tfrac12\\times2\\times1.5\\right)+2\\times4+2.5\\times4+1.5\\times4\\\\A_{\\text{ramp}}&=3+8+10+6=27\\\\\\text{SA}&=45+27-2(4\\times1.5)\\\\\\text{SA}&=60\\text{ m}^2\\end{align*}$$\nSubtract both joined faces.",
